#. src: scripts/addons_core/angelo_agent/assets/release_notes.json
msgid "After Restore snapshot or Undo restore, Save wrote into Angelo's private folder and the quit prompt offered a \"recovered-…\" file. The document is now your own file, marked unsaved."
